<mjml lang="en">
  <mj-head>
    <!--
      PROBE — footer long-address wrap, round 3 (2026-09-25).

      ══════════════════ VERDICTS — ALL CLAIMS MEASURED ══════════════════
      Sent 2026-09-25; EoA ruuyd3KoFUPKtoXN5u8CLRrNjm4poG3ySxjCUTdigbkHt.
      F1 CONTROL — Word (Outlook 2021, M365 Win11) stretches to 724px.
      F7 — PASS: Word holds 600px; only the address breaks; "San Francisco"
          stays whole in Word, Apple Mail and Gmail; the three <p>s read as
          one block. SHIPPED to all four footers the same day.
      F8 — PASS: a 24-character address never splits.
      ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

      Follows archive/probes/probe_paragraph-fix-and-footer-wrap.mjml (round 2,
      EoA 8lOZqo…): Word honours word-break:break-all on a <p> but not on a
      <span>, and on the whole footer <p> it also splits ordinary words
      ("San F/rancisco"). This round gives the ADDRESS its own <p>, so only
      the address can break.
      Not a catalog page. Build, paste dist/probe_footer-address-paragraph_live.html
      into an EN email, send to EoA. Read the DELIVERED HTML first, then
      Outlook 2021 Win11 and M365 Win11 (the two that stretched to 724px),
      then Apple Mail, Gmail and Outlook.com for how the wrap reads.

        F1 CONTROL  today's footer markup, 82-character address.
        F7          three <p>s: lead-in / address alone in a break-all <p> /
                    mailing address. Same 82-character address.
                    PASS = Word holds 600px AND "San Francisco" stays whole.
        F8          F7's shape with a realistic 24-character address.
                    PASS = the address does not split, and the three lines
                    read as one block (no gaps between the <p>s).
    -->
    <mj-raw>
      <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark" />
      <meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark" />
      <meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no" />
    </mj-raw>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-text color="#000000" font-size="18px" font-weight="400" font-family="Tahoma, sans-serif" line-height="24px" css-class="wysiwyg" />
      <mj-image padding="0" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-raw>
      <style type="text/css">
        .wysiwyg div p:first-child,
        .wysiwyg div h1:first-child,
        .wysiwyg div h2:first-child,
        .wysiwyg div h3:first-child,
        .wysiwyg div h4:first-child,
        .wysiwyg div h5:first-child,
        .wysiwyg div h6:first-child,
        .wysiwyg div ul:first-child,
        .wysiwyg div ol:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
        .wysiwyg div p:last-child,
        .wysiwyg div h1:last-child,
        .wysiwyg div h2:last-child,
        .wysiwyg div h3:last-child,
        .wysiwyg div h4:last-child,
        .wysiwyg div h5:last-child,
        .wysiwyg div h6:last-child,
        .wysiwyg div ul:last-child,
        .wysiwyg div ol:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
      </style>
    </mj-raw>
    <mj-include path="../styles.css" type="css" />
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#ffffff">
    <mj-raw><div style="color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;margin:0;padding:0;"><div class="email-ground" style="background-color:#ffffff;margin:0;padding:0;"></mj-raw>

    <!-- ══ F1 CONTROL ══ -->
    <mj-section padding="16px 32px 8px"><mj-column><mj-text padding="0"><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:18px;color:#362229;"><b>F1 CONTROL</b>: today's footer line</p></mj-text></mj-column></mj-section>
    <mj-section css-class="footer-block block" background-color="#362229" padding="32px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text css-class="wysiwyg link-inverse" color="#ffffff" align="center" padding="0">
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:18px;"><b>This email was sent by Trust for Public Land to<br /><a href="mailto:averyveryverylongmailboxnameforwraptesting.second.segment@exampleofalongdomain.org">averyveryverylongmailboxnameforwraptesting.second.segment@exampleofalongdomain.org</a>. Our mailing address is 23 Geary Street, Suite 1000, San Francisco, CA 94108.</b></p>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- ══ F7 ══ -->
    <mj-section padding="24px 32px 8px"><mj-column><mj-text padding="0"><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:18px;color:#362229;"><b>F7</b>: address in its own break-all paragraph (long address)</p></mj-text></mj-column></mj-section>
    <mj-section css-class="footer-block block" background-color="#362229" padding="32px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text css-class="wysiwyg link-inverse" color="#ffffff" align="center" padding="0">
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:18px;margin:0;"><b>This email was sent by Trust for Public Land to</b></p>
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:18px;margin:0;word-break:break-all;"><b><a href="mailto:averyveryverylongmailboxnameforwraptesting.second.segment@exampleofalongdomain.org">averyveryverylongmailboxnameforwraptesting.second.segment@exampleofalongdomain.org</a>.</b></p>
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:18px;margin:0;"><b>Our mailing address is 23 Geary Street, Suite 1000, San Francisco, CA 94108.</b></p>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- ══ F8 ══ -->
    <mj-section padding="24px 32px 8px"><mj-column><mj-text padding="0"><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:18px;color:#362229;"><b>F8</b>: same shape, realistic address</p></mj-text></mj-column></mj-section>
    <mj-section css-class="footer-block block" background-color="#362229" padding="32px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text css-class="wysiwyg link-inverse" color="#ffffff" align="center" padding="0">
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:18px;margin:0;"><b>This email was sent by Trust for Public Land to</b></p>
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:18px;margin:0;word-break:break-all;"><b><a href="mailto:jordan.smith@example.org">jordan.smith@example.org</a>.</b></p>
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:18px;margin:0;"><b>Our mailing address is 23 Geary Street, Suite 1000, San Francisco, CA 94108.</b></p>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section padding="0 0 32px"><mj-column><mj-spacer height="0px" /></mj-column></mj-section>

    <mj-raw></div></div></mj-raw>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
